# `collections.create_item`

Create an item in a collection (id auto-generated if omitted).

**Policy** — command `[C1_WORKSPACE]`. Capability `ship.collections.write`.

## Arguments

| name | type |
|------|------|
| `collection` | `string` |
| `data_json` | `string` |
| `id` | `string` |

## Returns

`CollectionItem` (JSON).

| field | type |
|-------|------|
| `id` | `string` |
| `collection` | `string` |
| `data_json` | `string` |
| `created_by` | `string` |
| `created_at` | `string` |
| `updated_at` | `string` |

## Invoke

```
ship ops call collections.create_item --json '{ "collection": "", "data_json": "", "id": "" }'
```

Kind: command.

